# single-point energy/force check (compare against an ASE reference)
units metal
newton on
atom_style atomic
atom_modify map yes
boundary p p p
read_data system.data
pair_style mliap unified ./bam_mliap_oeq.pt 0
pair_coeff * * H C O
thermo 1
dump d all custom 1 forces.dump id type fx fy fz
dump_modify d sort id format float %20.12g
run 0
